WEBVTT

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:32.244
won voice and representation,

00:05:32.286 --> 00:05:35.331
yet another kind of union developed.

00:05:35.373 --> 00:05:36.874
In my mind, in my ears,

00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:40.211
is Dolly Parton singing "9 to 5",

00:05:40.211 --> 00:05:44.298
inspired by a real-life
union of that name.

00:05:44.965 --> 00:05:46.884
When you hear that song,

00:05:46.926 --> 00:05:51.472
thank the unions for a decent working day.

00:05:53.766 --> 00:05:55.643
History shows

00:05:55.684 --> 00:06:01.440
that unions helped people
get dignity, rise out of poverty,